  "about": "KH2's own magic, cast through KH2's command executor (0x3D6FC0) so the spell's animation, effects, sounds, damage and MP cost are KH2's. The level a save has reached (SaveBase + saveOffset: 0 none, 1-3) picks the command id; the menu lists only spells the save has. target says who the caster aims at. castReach is how close the caster steps toward the target first (0 = casts from its place): only Fire works at melee range, every other spell is cast from the battler's own spot. castWindowSec is how long the caster may act before its turn ends.",
